---
---

<section class="apple-terminals-section" id="terminais" aria-labelledby="terminais-heading">
  <div class="apple-container">
    <div class="apple-section-header">
      <p class="apple-eyebrow-accent">REDE INTEGRADA</p>
      <h2 id="terminais-heading" class="apple-section-headline">
        Rede de Terminais.<br/>
        <span class="apple-headline-gradient">Toda a cidade conectada.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="apple-section-subhead">
        Consulte plataformas de embarque, conexões imediatas e status operacional dos 5 grandes terminais urbanos e estações de transferência de Manaus.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Apple Intuitive Terminal Grid -->
    <div class="apple-terminals-grid">
      <!-- T1 -->
      <div class="terminal-card">
        <div class="terminal-card-top-row">
          <div class="terminal-code-badge">T1</div>
          <div class="terminal-live-status">
            <span class="status-dot-green"></span>
            <span>Operando</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-region-tag">CENTRO HISTÓRICO</div>
        <h3 class="terminal-name">Terminal 1 — Constantino Nery</h3>
        <p class="terminal-desc">
          O portal central de Manaus. Integração dos corredores Norte e Sul com conexão direta às praças centrais e portos.
        </p>
        <div class="terminal-detail-pills">
          <span class="detail-pill">Plataformas A & B</span>
          <span class="detail-pill">Integração R$ 0,00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-lines-group">
          <span class="lines-label">Linhas Expressas:</span>
          <div class="terminal-lines-chips">
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">640</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">300</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">448</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">120</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- T2 -->
      <div class="terminal-card">
        <div class="terminal-card-top-row">
          <div class="terminal-code-badge">T2</div>
          <div class="terminal-live-status">
            <span class="status-dot-green"></span>
            <span>Operando</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-region-tag">ZONA SUL</div>
        <h3 class="terminal-name">Terminal 2 — Cachoeirinha</h3>
        <p class="terminal-desc">
          Conexão vital entre os bairros históricos da Zona Sul, Distrito Industrial I e orla fluvial do Educandos.
        </p>
        <div class="terminal-detail-pills">
          <span class="detail-pill">Av. Carvalho Leal</span>
          <span class="detail-pill">Polo Industrial</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-lines-group">
          <span class="lines-label">Linhas em Destaque:</span>
          <div class="terminal-lines-chips">
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">650</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">651</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-orange">542</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-orange">418</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- T3 -->
      <div class="terminal-card">
        <div class="terminal-card-top-row">
          <div class="terminal-code-badge">T3</div>
          <div class="terminal-live-status">
            <span class="status-dot-green"></span>
            <span>Operando</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-region-tag">ZONA NORTE</div>
        <h3 class="terminal-name">Terminal 3 — Cidade Nova</h3>
        <p class="terminal-desc">
          Principal centro distribuidor da maior bacia populacional de Manaus. Linhas alimentadoras e troncais diretas.
        </p>
        <div class="terminal-detail-pills">
          <span class="detail-pill">Av. Noel Nutels</span>
          <span class="detail-pill">Tronco Express</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-lines-group">
          <span class="lines-label">Linhas em Destaque:</span>
          <div class="terminal-lines-chips">
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">640</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">350</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-orange">450</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-orange">016</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- T4 -->
      <div class="terminal-card">
        <div class="terminal-card-top-row">
          <div class="terminal-code-badge">T4</div>
          <div class="terminal-live-status">
            <span class="status-dot-green"></span>
            <span>Operando</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-region-tag">ZONA LESTE</div>
        <h3 class="terminal-name">Terminal 4 — Jorge Teixeira</h3>
        <p class="terminal-desc">
          Eixo central de integração da Zona Leste na Av. Camapuã. Conexão expressa com o T3 e Centro via Linha 640.
        </p>
        <div class="terminal-detail-pills">
          <span class="detail-pill">Av. Camapuã</span>
          <span class="detail-pill">Integração T3/T4</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-lines-group">
          <span class="lines-label">Linhas em Destaque:</span>
          <div class="terminal-lines-chips">
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">640</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">652</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-orange">062</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-orange">065</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- T5 -->
      <div class="terminal-card">
        <div class="terminal-card-top-row">
          <div class="terminal-code-badge">T5</div>
          <div class="terminal-live-status">
            <span class="status-dot-green"></span>
            <span>Operando</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-region-tag">ZONA LESTE</div>
        <h3 class="terminal-name">Terminal 5 — São José Operário</h3>
        <p class="terminal-desc">
          Conecta o Grande Vitória e bairros da Zona Leste com os corredores troncais da Alameda Cosme Ferreira até o Centro.
        </p>
        <div class="terminal-detail-pills">
          <span class="detail-pill">Al. Cosme Ferreira</span>
          <span class="detail-pill">Bairro São José</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-lines-group">
          <span class="lines-label">Linhas em Destaque:</span>
          <div class="terminal-lines-chips">
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">652</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">600</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-orange">081</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-orange">084</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- E1 a E4 -->
      <div class="terminal-card terminal-card-transfer">
        <div class="terminal-card-top-row">
          <div class="terminal-code-badge">E1–E4</div>
          <div class="terminal-live-status">
            <span class="status-dot-green"></span>
            <span>Operando</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-region-tag">CORREDOR CONSTANTINO NERY</div>
        <h3 class="terminal-name">Estações de Transferência</h3>
        <p class="terminal-desc">
          Estações em nível no canteiro central: E1 (São Jorge), E2 (Arena), E3 (Santos Dumont) e E4 (Flores).
        </p>
        <div class="terminal-detail-pills">
          <span class="detail-pill">Embarque Central</span>
          <span class="detail-pill">Acessibilidade Total</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-lines-group">
          <span class="lines-label">Estações no Corredor:</span>
          <div class="terminal-lines-chips">
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">E1 São Jorge</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">E2 Arena</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">E3 Santos Dumont</span>
            <span class="chip-line chip-blue">E4 Flores</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
